{61}{I see we've begun on the wrong foot.  Please excuse me.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{70}{Insolent fool!  I'll have you run through!  Guards!}{Insolent wench!  I'll have you run through!  Guards!}{}{}{}{}
{71}{Pity.  And just as I was beginning to like you.  Guards!}{Pity.  And just as I was beginning to like you.  Guards!}{}{}{}{}
{72}{Has your tongue learned its lesson?  If so, begone.  You'll not be spared again.}{Has your tongue learned its lesson?  If so, begone.  You'll not be spared again.}{}{}{}{}
{73}{My humblest apologies, sire.  Good day.}{}{5}{}{}{fl 75}
