{91}{Probably not.  Good day to you.}{}{5}{}{}{}
{92}{The complexities of  the monarchy always intrigue me...}{}{5}{}{95}{}
{93}{A Prince has few confidants, but I'm here to lend an ear.}{}{5}{ps 12}{113}{re +10}
{95}{Indeed?  You might think differently if you'd been forced to endure the tragedies brought about by this crown...}{Indeed?  You might think differently if you'd been forced to endure the tragedies brought about by this crown...}{}{}{}{}
{96}{Of which tragedies do you speak?}{}{5}{}{119}{}
{97}{Might any of those have found their source in Cumbria?}{}{5}{ch -13}{142}{}
{98}{Might any of those have found their source in Cumbria?}{}{5}{ch 14}{125}{}
{99}{Your self-pity borders on the fantastic.}{}{5}{}{131}{}
{100}{Undoubtedly.  I'll waste no more of your time.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{102}{You're very perceptive.  Indeed, my mood hangs heavily today.  I've not seen my love for many months.}{You're very perceptive.  Indeed, my mood hangs heavily today.  I've not seen my love for many months.}{}{}{}{}
{103}{Ah.  Lovers--flowers of the heart, thorns of the soul.}{}{5}{ch 10}{108}{re +10}
{104}{It seems a chap like you could find other fish to fry.}{}{5}{}{168}{re -5}
{105}{Surely she's happy with whomever she's run off with.}{}{5}{}{138}{re -10}
{106}{Of whom do you speak?}{}{5}{}{113}{}
{108}{A kindred spirit!  You've lightened my burden, if only because I know you've carried it as well.  My thanks to you, my friend...}{A kindred spirit!  You've lightened my burden, if only because I know you've carried it as well.  My thanks to you, my friend...}{}{}{}{}
{109}{You're very welcome.  Who is this love you speak of?}{}{5}{}{113}{}
{110}{Always glad to be of service.  Good bye.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{113}{I've told very few of my predicament, but you seem very trustworthy.  You see, I'm in love with Aria, princess of Cumbria.}{I've told very few of my predicament, but you seem very trustworthy.  You see, I'm in love with Aria, princess of Cumbria.}{}{}{}{}
{114}{Yes, I know of her.  I'm afraid I have some bad news.}{}{5}{gf2696 1}{147}{}
{115}{Yes, I know of her.  I'm afraid I have some bad news.}{}{5}{gf2696 1}{147}{}
{116}{Yes, I've heard. Her father sent me here to fetch her.}{}{5}{}{213}{}
{117}{How very beautiful.  Please tell me more.}{}{5}{}{172}{re +10}
{119}{Tragedies of the heart, my friend.   Even men such as are powerless before love and its strange ways.}{Tragedies of the heart, my friend.   I'm sure you're no stranger to love and its strange ways.}{}{}{}{}
{120}{Speak for yourself, weakling.  Love is for poets.}{1}{5}{}{131}{re -10}
