{142}{A stranger who comes to my kingdom speaking of Cumbria is either unwise or unwelcome.  A timely explanation is in order, and I won't ask again.}{A stranger who comes to my kingdom speaking of Cumbria is either unwise or unwelcome.  A timely explanation is in order, and I won't ask again.}{}{}{}{}
