{172}{Very well. The story is a sad one.  A year ago, I met Princess Aria of Cumbria while negotiating peace between two of our more remote villages.  I knew almost immediately that we were destined to be lovers, and after only a few days we had pledged our lives to one another. }{Very well. The story is a sad one.  A year ago, I met Princess Aria of Cumbria while negotiating peace between two of our more remote villages.  I knew almost immediately that we were destined to be lovers, and after only a few days we had pledged our lives to one another. }{}{}{}{}
