{202}{I don't think I should get involved.  Good bye.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{204}{Very well.  Against my father's wishes, I sent a ship, the Elizabeth Dane, to retrieve Aria three months ago.  It took the southern route, around Razors Pointe.   I've heard no word since.  I fear the captain was captured by Praetor, and that my intentions were made known to him.}{Very well.  Against my father's wishes, I sent a ship, the Elizabeth Dane, to retrieve Aria three months ago.  It took the southern route, around Razors Pointe.   I've heard no word since.  I fear the captain was captured by Praetor, and that my intentions were made known to him.}{}{}{}{}
